# Generated evidence — must always be reproducible by re-running scenarios.
# Nothing here is hand-authored; if it cannot be regenerated, it is not evidence.
#
# One generated set IS committed, so a reviewer can read the audit trail without
# running anything. It stays regenerable: `python -m scenarios.cli run all`
# reproduces it, and the committed copy is only ever refreshed from that command.
# Anything a run drops here beyond the three canonical bundles stays ignored.
evidence/*
!evidence/README.md
!evidence/s-01-greenfield/
!evidence/s-02-brownfield/
!evidence/s-03-ambiguous/

# Phase 00 intake notes restate the assessment source document closely and are
# excluded from the published repository per decision D-006.
plan/phases/00-assessment-intake/

# Local runtime state
*.db
*.sqlite3
tmp/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
